				- Brotherhood Leader Ill -<br>
<br>
Rumors about the failing health of one of the Wayfarers Brotherhood leaders, Nedaria Debeian, have drifted from the Abysmal Sea to the rest of Norrath.<br>
<br>
Those who claim to have seen Nedaria in recent days suggest she is near death.<br>
<br>
Nedaria's aides, Wuria Pyskar and Parillin Shurava, claim the Erudite simply has a temporary viral illness.<br>
<br>
"She is just fine and will be back on her feet very soon," Wuria said. "We sit with her all day and tend to her needs as she gets over this sickness."<br>
<br>
Others claim to have seen several shamans and clerics entering Nedaria's chambers and exiting with no answer or cure for the frail female.<br>
<br>
- Arborean Sapling Causes Small Forest Fire -<br>
<br>
An arborean sapling recently caused a small forest fire when it inadvertently walked through an unattended campfire and then into a small copse of trees.<br>
<br>
Ranger Tyimil Woodfriend warned campers to extinguish all campfires before leaving their campsites.<br>
<br>
"This hasn't become a huge problem thankfully, but as you can imagine, a forest fire is something we do no want." <br>
<br>
The burned sapling was listed to be in serious, but stable, condition. <br>
